            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Xeo Hoang Van Thu",
            "review_text": "tringuyenis\nHouston, Texas11 contributions\n0\nExcellent authentic Vietnamese food and great service\nJan 2020\nHad dinner at this restaurant. The food was delicious and service was great. To my surprise, the portion is relatively large compared to other restaurants in Da Nang. I ordered spring rolls, papaya salad and the typical Da Nang noodle My Quang. I was ordered their specialty lemongrass lemon juice as well. All were excellent. The ambient was warm and enticing. I would definitely come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 10, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
